                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>The </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>Accomplished Estimated Times</run>
                <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'> tab tracks whether the promised Pickup and Delivery times were met. In case of VD and PU Orders it also shows the misusage of the Dispatch feature by the Vendors.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#000000'>For better understanding of each metric it is encouraged to check the Definitions tab, as well as our documentation in Confluence:</run>
